### Instrumented run history
# Local observation of the local-only suite (ADR 0001): what ran, what failed, what
# stalled. Deliberately outside build/ so `./gradlew clean` doesn't wipe months of
# evidence, and deliberately not committed — it would put a merge conflict in the
# path of every run. Read it with ./scripts/flaky-report.sh.
.instrumented-history/

